Source location: https://github.com/kael-shipman/co-sensor

You may build, sell and modify co-sensor. If you distribute it, or anything made from a
modified version, you must share those modifications under the same licence. Each kind of
content uses a licence written for it:

  Firmware, tests and build tooling      GPL-3.0-or-later
    firmware/, tests/, Makefile

  Hardware: enclosure and hardware notes CERN-OHL-S-2.0 (strongly reciprocal)
    enclosure/, hardware/

  Documentation and photos               CC-BY-SA-4.0
    README.md, VISION.md, RESUME.md, docs/, and anything not listed above

The full licence texts are in LICENSES/. REUSE.toml maps every file to its licence in
machine-readable form (https://reuse.software). This summary is not legal advice; where it
and a licence text differ, the licence text applies.
